146 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 89 0 R
/T (The NAPDC hosted a scientific session at ASABE-AIM in Indianapolis. Attendance was strong and the presenters did an awesome job highlighting advances and challenges in data, automation, and digital agriculture.  Session materials will be added to the NAPDC website as soon as we collect them. A big thank you to everyone who participated! The conference included a student robotics competition, multiple poster sessions, and lots of cutting edge academic and industry research. Ziwen Yu from the University of Florida hosted a related session on data standards and the legal status of data, including speakers representing ISO TC 347 and AEF. Fascinating! Please see below for upcoming events that may be of interest to you. )
/E (The NAPDC hosted a scientific session at ASABE-AIM in Indianapolis. Attendance was strong and the presenters did an awesome job highlighting advances and challenges in data, automation, and digital agriculture.  Session materials will be added to the NAPDC website as soon as we collect them. A big thank you to everyone who participated! The conference included a student robotics competition, multiple poster sessions, and lots of cutting edge academic and industry research. Ziwen Yu from the University of Florida hosted a related session on data standards and the legal status of data, including speakers representing ISO TC 347 and AEF. Fascinating! Please see below for upcoming events that may be of interest to you. )
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
